  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Echoing Green (EG) COVID 19 - Eggpreneur Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to provide seed capital to Matt Dickson to save 340 womens micro-poultry businesses from bankrupting and to keep ongoing projects afloat. Most of the funds will be used to increase the ventures value by slaughtering chickens to be used as essential product. The chicken meat will be transported to markets in the city and the leftovers will be donated to the women who have lost their chickens to hunger. This will help the womens microbusiness thrive. Eggpreneur Initiative will also deviate from door-to-door to online marketing platforms as well as purchase masks and hand sanitizers for employees to maintain safety in direct support of preventing the spread of COVID-19. The women Eggpreneurs are struggling to provide their families with food because their chicken business has collapsed. Mental health counseling will be offered to support the women during this crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
